      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Yesterday, I joined @CBP and @CBPCommissioner for a fireside chat with CBP’s senior leaders at the Advanced Training Center in Harpers Ferry.\n\nThis is where the next generation of CBP leaders is forged—training more than 8,000 students this fiscal year to protect our homeland.\n\nThe results speak for themselves:\n\n➡️14 straight months of zero releases at the border, the most secure border in our nation’s history\n➡️42% increase in fentanyl seizures from May to June alone\n➡️ Southwest border apprehensions are DOWN 94% since President Trump took office\n\nThe men and women of CBP are delivering on @POTUS Trump’s mission every single day.",
      "text_resolved": "Yesterday, I joined @CBP and @CBPCommissioner for a fireside chat with CBP’s senior leaders at the Advanced Training Center in Harpers Ferry.\n\nThis is where the next generation of CBP leaders is forged—training more than 8,000 students this fiscal year to protect our homeland.\n\nThe results speak for themselves:\n\n➡️14 straight months of zero releases at the border, the most secure border in our nation’s history\n➡️42% increase in fentanyl seizures from May to June alone\n➡️ Southwest border apprehensions are DOWN 94% since President Trump took office\n\nThe men and women of CBP are delivering on @POTUS Trump’s mission every single day.",
